{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Star Wyrm","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/star-wyrm.webp","scaleX":3,"scaleY":3,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":3,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/star-wyrm.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Star Wyrm","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":335,"temp":0,"max":335,"details":""},"ac":{"value":43,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":40,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":150}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"sleep","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"precision","value":20,"exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"void","value":20,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["draconic"],"details":""},"level":{"value":19},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Star wyrms are beings similar to true dragons that live in the vacuum of space. They appear as countless motes of light that gather into the shape of a dragon. Intensely social creatures, their social groups—called constellations—are metaphysically connected. They are almost never found alone and occasionally ally with other kinds of creatures.</p>\n<p>As a loose collection of smaller elements, star wyrms are greatly harmed by foes who disrupt their integrity with precise strikes at their component stars.</p>\n<h2>Fusion Cuisine</h2>\n<p>The star wyrm's digestion process resembles the processing of raw materials in the hearts of stars. The results are an alchemist's dream come true, with organic material transforming into metals and base metals turning into precious ones. A star wyrm's conception of treasure revolves around philosophical concepts, for otherwise their latrines would be their hoards.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 5,000/12,000/22,500 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing, slashing), armor (light, medium, heavy), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Diplomacy, Intimidation, Occultism, Stealth)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, charisma, constitution, elongating, energy resistant (positive, negative), fire, lawful, light, negative, positive, strength, wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Joshua White","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":10},"dex":{"mod":5},"con":{"mod":9},"int":{"mod":6},"wis":{"mod":5},"cha":{"mod":9}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":32,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":36,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":32,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":29,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":33},"athletics":{"base":37},"diplomacy":{"base":37},"intimidation":{"base":33},"occultism":{"base":35},"stealth":{"base":33}},"traits":{"value":["dragon","lawful","light"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"lg"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/star-wyrm.webp","items":[{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Bolster Ally","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> the star wyrm gains temporary Hit Points from a source other than another creature's Bolster Ally</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> One of the star wyrm's allies within 30 feet gains half as many temporary Hit Points as the star wyrm did. These temporary Hit Points last for 1 minute.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"yPeOmAbx25VlJ3Tf","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689101560960,"modifiedTime":1689101587441,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Extra Reaction","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The wyrm gains 2 reactions at the start of its turn each round.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"va