":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689101823383,"modifiedTime":1689101894313,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Tail","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["reach-20"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"aguvxS6ZjqDhO7CZ":{"damage":"4d12+16","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":36},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"mlZy7VGQtT5qDTJL","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689101824697,"modifiedTime":1689101935328,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Breath Weapon","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The wyrm breathes in one of two ways, as determined by its Celestial Attunement. The wyrm can't use its Breath Weapon again for [[/br 1d4 #its Breath Weapon Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Void</strong> (arcane, necromancy, negative) The wyrm breathes out the soul-sucking emptiness between stars in a @Template[type:cone|distance:50] that deals @Damage[12d10[void]] damage (@Check[type:fortitude|dc:42|basic:true|traits:arcane,necromancy,void] save). The wyrm gains temporary Hit Points equal to half the damage a single creature takes from the Breath Weapon; calculate these temporary Hit Points using the creature that took the most damage. These temporary Hit Points last 1 minute.</li>\n<li><strong>Nebula</strong> (arcane, evocation, fire, positive) The wyrm breathes the primordial stuff of proto-stars in a @Template[type:cone|distance:50] that deals [[/r 20d6[fire]]] damage (@Check[type:reflex|dc:42|basic:true|traits:arcane,evocation,fire,vitality] save) to the wyrm's foes in the area, or positive damage to undead foes, whichever is worse for each undead foe. The wyrm's allies in the area instead heal half as many Hit Points.</li>\n</ul>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"2dPhqftUGe5uFjbd","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689101941560,"modifiedTime":1691261012488,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Share Attunement","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The star wyrm shares its cosmic energy with an ally that doesn't have the Celestial Attunement ability within 30 feet. Each time that ally deals damage with a Strike before the start of the wyrm's next turn, they add the additional damage from the wyrm's Leaking Power.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-effects.Item.I4k1g6aaS6FbkKlv]{Effect: Share Attunement}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","li